(7622514, 1234940, 140305, '<td valign="top">Pretty sure it''s Clonmacnoise, we visited in 2014. That time-worn rock most definitely holds near the spirits of those who once inhabited the place and of those who are laid to rest. I love that there are birds flying through the frame, I''ve nothing against crows, or are they gulls? Either way, glad they''re included.</td>', 'Pretty sure it''s Clonmacnoise, we visited in 2014. That time-worn rock most definitely holds near the spirits of those who once inhabited the place and of those who are laid to rest. I love that there are birds flying through the frame, I''ve nothing against crows, or are they gulls? Either way, glad they''re included.', '2019-03-29 12:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7622534, 1234957, 99263, '<td valign="top">Pity about the chromatic aberrations on the trees and what looks like dirt and dust on your camera sensor in the sky.</td>', 'Pity about the chromatic aberrations on the trees and what looks like dirt and dust on your camera sensor in the sky.', '2019-03-29 15:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
