(7622666, 1234365, 59740, '<td valign="top">I like your photo but would like it even better if the right side distortion was corrected. I also seems a little dark but that may be intentional.</td>', 'I like your photo but would like it even better if the right side distortion was corrected. I also seems a little dark but that may be intentional.', '2019-03-30 17:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7622667, 1234940, 59740, '<td valign="top">Great photo but I''m not sure it fits the category that well. The church which I guess is the main subject seems diminished by the grave markers.</td>', 'Great photo but I''m not sure it fits the category that well. The church which I guess is the main subject seems diminished by the grave markers.', '2019-03-30 17:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
