(7622683, 1234933, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I might have made it a little tighter composition but thst''s nit picking.</td>', 'Nice shot. I might have made it a little tighter composition but thst''s nit picking.', '2019-03-30 17:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
