(7623553, 1234921, 99263, '<td valign="top">Definitely and unmistakenly an Ammie. Lovely image and very nice processing. Typical Boer Farm Building and of course the Maluti''s in the background ;) I wonder if you can find my entry?</td>', 'Definitely and unmistakenly an Ammie. Lovely image and very nice processing. Typical Boer Farm Building and of course the Maluti''s in the background ;) I wonder if you can find my entry?', '2019-04-04 17:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7623554, 1234855, 99263, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred if you had straightened the image in it''s true perspective. I think having it all slanted does not add anything. I presume you did it on purpose. Nice processing with nice textures and contrast.</td>', 'Would have preferred if you had straightened the image in it''s true perspective. I think having it all slanted does not add anything. I presume you did it on purpose. Nice processing with nice textures and contrast.', '2019-04-04 17:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
