(7623582, 1234365, 114285, '<td valign="top">Always makes you wonder what happened for this to come to this decrepit state, where is the owner? Surely this land belongs to someone, why isnt it on the market, why isnt someone going to do an amazing fixer upper  on it?  Questions questions my life is full of questions!!</td>', 'Always makes you wonder what happened for this to come to this decrepit state, where is the owner? Surely this land belongs to someone, why isnt it on the market, why isnt someone going to do an amazing fixer upper  on it?  Questions questions my life is full of questions!!', '2019-04-05 01:28:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7623583, 1234954, 68504, '<td valign="top">no more malt.</td>', 'no more malt.', '2019-04-05 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7623596, 1234847, 173844, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8, Roz, my highest mark.  The light imbues every part of the image with sparkling, enthusiastic life.  I love how the tree and the side of the building play together -- it''s as if the tree is trying to draw the building into dancing.  It''s a joyful interplay.  I like the grassy expanse which spreads throughout.  It''s a lovely photograph.<br/>My theory about why it hasn''t received a higher result is that some people felt that it didn''t have sufficient "building."  Their literal threshold wasn''t met.  My personal opinion is that such an approach is narrow-minded and tosses away many fine images that merely include the challenge subject in a larger whole.  In other words, artistry is given short shrift.  So likewise regard these marks with a shrug of the shoulder and a soupcon (with that squiggle under the c) of pity.</td>', 'I gave this an 8, Roz, my highest mark.  The light imbues every part of the image with sparkling, enthusiastic life.  I love how the tree and the side of the building play together -- it''s as if the tree is trying to draw the building into dancing.  It''s a joyful interplay.  I like the grassy expanse which spreads throughout.  It''s a lovely photograph.My theory about why it hasn''t received a higher result is that some people felt that it didn''t have sufficient "building."  Their literal threshold wasn''t met.  My personal opinion is that such an approach is narrow-minded and tosses away many fine images that merely include the challenge subject in a larger whole.  In other words, artistry is given short shrift.  So likewise regard these marks with a shrug of the shoulder and a soupcon (with that squiggle under the c) of pity.', '2019-04-05 09:09:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7623607, 1234847, 113156, '<td valign="top">This is quite spectacular, in fact it couldnt have been better, if Id have voted Im sure this would have been my top pick.</td>', 'This is quite spectacular, in fact it couldnt have been better, if Id have voted Im sure this would have been my top pick.', '2019-04-05 16:01:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7623609, 1234954, 113156, '<td valign="top">If this is paradise, I wish I had my lawnmower. To me the trees make the abandonment more apparent, its as if they are ganging up waiting for the final push.</td>', 'If this is paradise, I wish I had my lawnmower. To me the trees make the abandonment more apparent, its as if they are ganging up waiting for the final push.', '2019-04-05 16:06:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7623645, 1234855, 59029, '<td valign="top">Woot! I was not expecting a red with this pic.  Not complaining!<br/> <br/>Yes, I do know I could have made an attempt to straighten the verticals esp as I shot with Siggy, my wide angle lens.  HOWEVER, the angles in that house basically are as extreme as they appear to be in the pic, and the whole idea behind a challenge like this is to show a decrepit, rundown caving in old building....right?</td>', 'Woot! I was not expecting a red with this pic.  Not complaining! Yes, I do know I could have made an attempt to straighten the verticals esp as I shot with Siggy, my wide angle lens.  HOWEVER, the angles in that house basically are as extreme as they appear to be in the pic, and the whole idea behind a challenge like this is to show a decrepit, rundown caving in old building....right?', '2019-04-05 18:09:38.000000', NULL, 0),
